  Used: the "components are copied source into the project, not a dependency" model, and the
  condensed implementation conventions in `references/rules.md` (semantic theme tokens, class-name
  merging, spacing utilities, variant ordering, one primitive family, one icon library, composition
  over duplication, pairing with an existing form library).

